<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Returns a string from the tlk table based on the specified strref (String reference) and gender. It should be noted that there may be multiple genders in the tlk table depending on how the specific tlk table is generated.
</p><p>"Gender" in this case refers to grammatical gender. For most of the lines of dialogue in the game plot flags are used to choose between different lines referring to the player, so this does not actually come up much.
</p>
